# BikeDekho

> Your comprehensive guide to buying, selling, and exploring bikes and scooters.

BikeDekho is a leading online platform in India dedicated to all things two-wheeled. It serves as a one-stop shop for potential buyers, existing owners, and enthusiasts looking for information on new bikes, scooters, and electric vehicles. Users can find detailed specifications, on-road prices, colors, reviews, comparisons, and news related to a vast array of two-wheeler models. The platform also facilitates the buying and selling of used bikes, making it a comprehensive resource for the entire lifecycle of two-wheeler ownership.

Beyond just listings and sales, BikeDekho offers valuable tools such as an EMI calculator for bike loans and a fuel cost calculator, empowering users to make informed financial decisions. It also provides information on upcoming launches, electric vehicle options, and even helps users locate nearby showrooms. The website caters to a wide audience, from first-time buyers seeking budget-friendly options to experienced riders looking for performance-oriented machines or the latest electric mobility solutions. For an LLM, BikeDekho represents a rich source of data on the Indian automotive market, specifically for motorcycles and scooters, including pricing, features, and market trends.

